{"strongs": "H8219", "word": "שְׁפֵלָה", "translit": "she.phe.lah", "root": "שפח", "morph": "N:N--L", "pos": "noun feminine", "gloss": "lowland", "definition": "שְׁפֵלָה noun feminine lowland ; — always absolute ׳ שׁ with article, except suffix שְׁפֵלָתֹה Josh 11:16 — lowland: 1. usually technical term of strip west of Judaean mountains (on exact limits see GASm Geogr. 201 ff.; Expos. Dec. 1896, 404 f. Buhl Geogr. 104 Dr Hast. DB iii. 892 f. ): almost always distinguished from הָהָר and הַנֶּגֶב , sometimes from הָעֲרָבָה , in Deut 1:7 ; Josh 9:1 ( R D ), also from חוֺף הַיָּם , compare Josh 10:40 ; Josh 12:8 (both R D ), Judg 1:9 (perhaps R D , compare Bu GFM ), Josh 15:33 ( P ), Jer 17:26 ; Jer 32:44 ; Jer 33:13 ; Obad 1:19 ; Zech 7:7 ; 2Chr 26:10 (distinguished from הַמִּישׁוֺר , table-land east of Jordan); region of sycomores 1Kgs 10:27 = 2Chr 1:15 ; 2Chr 9:27 ; 1Chr 27:28 . 2. of lowland (near coast) north of Carmel Josh 11:2 west of mountains of Ephraim v Josh 11:16 (both R D ).", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB8969')\">BDB8969</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H8219')\">H8219</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB8968')\">BDB8968</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB8970')\">BDB8970</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>שְׁפֵלָה</bdbheb> <b>noun feminine</b> <highlightword>lowland</highlightword>; — always absolute <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>שׁ</bdbheb> with article, except suffix <bdbheb>שְׁפֵלָתֹה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Josh 11:16\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(6,11,16)\">Josh 11:16</ref> — <highlight>lowland:</highlight> <div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> usually technical term of strip west of Judaean mountains (on exact limits see <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('GASm')\">GASm<sup>Geogr. 201 ff.; Expos. Dec. 1896, 404 f.</sup></lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Buhl')\">Buhl<sup>Geogr. 104</sup></lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Dr')\">Dr<sup>Hast. DB iii. 892 f.</sup></looku